        'Alternative normalisers (Harada 1.7", J-matched where possible), HCN/norm and HCO+/norm N/S: C18O 1-0: 1.48 [1.26,1.73] / 0.99 [0.85,1.16]; CS 2-1: 1.63 [1.41,1.88] / 1.09 [0.94,1.26]; 13CO 1-0: 3.62 / 2.43 (13CO is optically thick and N/S 13CO(1-0)=0.96: not a mass tracer); C18O 2-1 with 3-2: 1.16 [0.99,1.35] / 0.60 [0.52,0.70]; CS 5-4 with 3-2: 1.20 / 0.62. '
